                    "content": "# Capacitated facility location–allocation problem for wastewater treatment in an industrial cluster. We present a location–allocation wastewater treatment in an industrial cluster. We present a non-convex MINLP formulation for the problem. An exact convexification strategy proposed for a special case of the problem. An Outer Approximation based solution approach is suggested for the special case. We present a location–allocation problem for wastewater treatment in a cluster of processing units. This problem is formulated as a non-convex mixed integer nonlinear programming (MINLP) problem. For the general class of this problem, solution strategies based on adapted McCormick envelopes and also piece-wise linear approximation are presented. For a special case of this problem, an exact convexification strategy is proposed and an outer approximation based branch-and-cut approach is presented as an exact solution method. In this paper, we present a new variant of the facility location–allocation problem to address the problem of designing a network of SWTPs for an industrial cluster.",
